        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_170_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_169_1#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_170_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_169_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"海蒂\"]  没错——啊，不是，是出于学习目的，遵循家父的指导。",
